<title>USA: Lidak herpes drug successful in trials.</title>
<headline>Lidak herpes drug successful in trials.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lidak Pharmaceuticals said Thursday its Lidakol drug for recurrent oral herpes was shown in Phase III clinical trials to reduce the healing time in acute herpes episodes.</p>
<p>The company said it is prepared to file a new drug application with the Food and Drug Administration by the end of this year.</p>
